<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Kingsway Spirit | Journey to India</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0b0b0b;--text:#f6f1e7;--gold:#c8a96a;--line:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{margin:0;background:#0b0b0b;color:var(--text);font-family:Inter,sans-serif;line-height:1.7}
    h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;margin:0;line-height:1.1}
    a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.container{width:min(1140px,calc(100% - 32px));margin:0 auto}
    header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:rgba(11,11,11,.88);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:18px 0}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.brand img{height:44px}.brand-text{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.22em;font-size:14px}
    nav ul{display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}nav a{color:rgba(246,241,231,.72);font-size:14px}
    .hero{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#050505}
    .hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-10%;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.28),rgba(0,0,0,.88)),radial-gradient(circle at 25% 25%,rgba(200,169,106,.18),transparent 34%),radial-gradient(circle at 78% 60%,rgba(28,43,34,.35),transparent 36%),url('../heritage.jpg');background-size:cover;background-position:center;opacity:.38;animation:drift 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
    .hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.85),rgba(0,0,0,.36),rgba(0,0,0,.88))}
    .hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:2;text-align:center;padding:110px 0}.eyebrow{color:var(--gold);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4em;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:20px}
    h1{font-size:clamp(46px,8vw,92px)}.lead{max-width:820px;margin:28px auto 0;color:rgba(246,241,231,.78);font-size:20px}.gold-line{width:0;height:1px;margin:34px auto 0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#c8a96a,#f3dfb4,#c8a96a,transparent);animation:lineGrow 2.4s ease forwards}
    section{padding:110px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.section-head{max-width:880px;margin-bottom:44px}.section-head h2{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,64px)}.section-head p{margin-top:20px;color:rgba(246,241,231,.72);font-size:18px}
    .counter-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}.counter-card{padding:30px 18px;border-radius:26px;border:1px solid rgba(200,169,106,.22);background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);text-align:center}.counter-number{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,58px);color:#d9bf8a}.counter-label{margin-top:8px;color:rgba(246,241,231,.66);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.22em;font-size:11px}
    .route-map{border:1px solid rgba(200,169,106,.22);border-radius:34px;padding:42px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);position:relative;overflow:hidden}.route-line{position:absolute;left:18%;right:18%;top:50%;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c8a96a,rgba(200,169,106,.14),#c8a96a);animation:pulse 3s ease-in-out infinite}.route-grid{position:relative;z-index:2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px}.route-node{min-height:300px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;border-radius:28px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.36);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);padding:32px}.route-dot{width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#c8a96a;box-shadow:0 0 36px rgba(200,169,106,.7);margin-bottom:22px}.route-node h3{font-size:36px}.route-node p{color:rgba(246,241,231,.7);max-width:380px}
    .timeline{position:relative;display:grid;gap:22px}.timeline:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:22px;top:8px;bottom:8px;width:1px;background:linear-gradient(#c8a96a,rgba(200,169,106,.08))}.timeline-item{position:relative;padding:28px 30px 28px 72px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border-radius:24px;transition:.4s ease}.timeline-item:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:rgba(200,169,106,.36)}.timeline-item:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:14px;top:34px;width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:50%;background:#c8a96a;box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(200,169,106,.5)}.timeline-date{color:#d9bf8a;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.28em;font-size:11px;margin-bottom:8px}
    .parallax{background:radial-gradient(circle at center,rgba(200,169,106,.11),transparent 42%),#050505;text-align:center}.parallax h2{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,72px)}.parallax p{max-width:760px;margin:22px auto 0;color:rgba(246,241,231,.74);font-size:19px}.cta-row{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:34px}.btn{display:inline-block;padding:15px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:800}.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c8a96a,#ead6a5);color:#000}.btn-secondary{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);color:var(--text)}
    footer{padding:34px 0;text-align:center;color:rgba(246,241,231,.48)}
    @keyframes drift{from{transform:scale(1.08) translateX(-1%)}to{transform:scale(1.14) translateX(1%)}}@keyframes lineGrow{to{width:min(480px,80vw)}}@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:.45}50%{opacity:1}}
    @media(max-width:900px){.counter-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.route-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.route-line{display:none}.nav{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}@media(max-width:560px){.counter-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header><div class="container nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="../logo.png" alt="Kingsway Spirit Logo"><div class="brand-text">KINGSWAY SPIRIT</div></a><nav><ul><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/distilling-partner/">Sky Wave</a></li><li><a href="/founding-circle/">Founding Circle</a></li></ul></nav></div></header>
  <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-inner"><div class="eyebrow">Journey to India</div><h1>From Oxfordshire craft to India’s premium spirits landscape.</h1><div class="gold-line"></div><p class="lead">A visual story of British distillation, production, export preparation and market activation — bringing carefully selected craft spirits closer to discerning consumers in India.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#timeline">Explore Timeline</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/distilling-partner/">Meet Sky Wave</a></div></div></section>
  <section><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Momentum</div><h2>Progress that can be measured.</h2><p>Every purchase order, approval, production run and shipment moves Kingsway Spirit from vision to market reality.</p></div><div class="counter-grid"><div class="counter-card"><div class="counter-number" data-count="1">0</div><div class="counter-label">First Shipment</div></div><div class="counter-card"><div class="counter-number" data-count="2">0</div><div class="counter-label">Countries Connected</div></div><div class="counter-card"><div class="counter-number" data-count="2026">0</div><div class="counter-label">Launch Journey</div></div><div class="counter-card"><div class="counter-number">∞</div><div class="counter-label">Long-Term Vision</div></div></div></div></section>
  <section><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Route</div><h2>Oxfordshire to India.</h2><p>A premium spirits journey shaped by craftsmanship, compliance, logistics and market discipline.</p></div><div class="route-map"><div class="route-line"></div><div class="route-grid"><div class="route-node"><div class="route-dot"></div><h3>Oxfordshire</h3><p>Independent British craft distilling, led by quality, innovation and the Spirit of Oxfordshire®.</p></div><div class="route-node"><div class="route-dot"></div><h3>India</h3><p>A fast-evolving premium market prepared through registration, distribution and carefully curated trade activation.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
  <section id="timeline"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Timeline</div><h2>The journey from concept to shipment.</h2></div><div class="timeline"><div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">Stage 01</div><h3>Partner Selection</h3><p>Identifying a British craft distilling partner aligned with Kingsway Spirit’s standards for quality, craftsmanship and international credibility.</p></div><div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">Stage 02</div><h3>Commercial Planning</h3><p>Preparing the India market-entry strategy across regulatory, supply-chain, hospitality and distribution priorities.</p></div><div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">Stage 03</div><h3>Production Purchase Order</h3><p>The first international production purchase order marks the transition from planning into manufacturing for India.</p></div><div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">Stage 04</div><h3>Manufacturing & Export Preparation</h3><p>Production, export documentation, logistics coordination and shipment preparation move the project toward arrival in India.</p></div><div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">Stage 05</div><h3>Registrations & Market Activation</h3><p>State-level registrations, premium trade engagement and launch activity support the introduction to India’s discerning spirits audience.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="parallax"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">British Craft. Indian Opportunity.</div><h2>Every milestone brings the launch closer.</h2><p>Kingsway Spirit is building patiently and deliberately — with trusted partners, careful execution and a long-term view of the Indian premium spirits market.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/founding-circle/">Join the Founding Circle</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="mailto:support@kingswayspirit.com">Trade Enquiries</a></div></div></section>
  <footer>© 2026 Kingsway Spirit. Crafted in Europe. Curated for India.</footer>
  <script>
    function animateCounters(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-count]').forEach(el=>{const target=parseInt(el.getAttribute('data-count'),10);let current=0;const inc=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(target/70));const tick=setInterval(()=>{current+=inc;if(current>=target){current=target;clearInterval(tick)}el.textContent=current},22)})}
    window.addEventListener('load',()=>setTimeout(animateCounters,700));
  </script>
</body>
</html>
